{
  "dinner": {
    "version": 1,
    "id": "dinner",
    "title": "周末晚餐计划",
    "inputs": [
      {
        "id": "people",
        "kind": "number",
        "label": "用餐人数",
        "initial": 4,
        "min": 2,
        "max": 8,
        "step": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "main",
        "kind": "choice",
        "label": "选择主菜",
        "initial": "chicken",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "chicken",
            "label": "宫保鸡丁",
            "description": "约 25 分钟 · 微辣酸甜"
          },
          {
            "id": "beef",
            "label": "番茄炖牛腩",
            "description": "约 100 分钟 · 浓郁软烂"
          },
          {
            "id": "tofu",
            "label": "香菇烧豆腐",
            "description": "约 20 分钟 · 鲜香清淡"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "resources": [],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "intro",
        "kind": "text",
        "markdown": "三道家常菜，按人数调整采购量。以下为示例食谱估算，可按口味调整。"
      },
      {
        "id": "controls",
        "kind": "controls",
        "inputIds": [
          "people",
          "main"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "menu",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "本次菜单",
        "items": [
          {
            "id": "side",
            "title": "蒜蓉西兰花",
            "description": "清爽配菜",
            "facts": [
              "约 10 分钟",
              "临开饭前炒制"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "cold",
            "title": "拍黄瓜",
            "description": "开胃凉菜",
            "facts": [
              "约 10 分钟",
              "可提前准备"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "rice",
            "title": "米饭",
            "description": "按胃口准备主食",
            "facts": [
              "电饭煲先煮",
              "和主菜同时上桌"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "shopping",
        "kind": "checklist",
        "title": "采购清单",
        "items": [
          {
            "id": "chicken",
            "label": "去骨鸡腿肉",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 600,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "chicken"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "peanut",
            "label": "熟花生米",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 100,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "chicken"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "beef",
            "label": "牛腩",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 800,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "beef"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "tomato",
            "label": "番茄",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 500,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "beef"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "tofu",
            "label": "豆腐",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 600,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "tofu"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "mushroom",
            "label": "香菇",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 200,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "tofu"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "broccoli",
            "label": "西兰花",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 500,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "cucumber",
            "label": "黄瓜",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 500,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "garlic-side",
            "label": "大蒜",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 30,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "itemKey": "garlic"
          },
          {
            "id": "garlic-main",
            "label": "大蒜",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 5,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "chicken"
            },
            "itemKey": "garlic"
          },
          {
            "id": "ginger",
            "label": "生姜",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 20,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "steps",
        "kind": "disclosure",
        "title": "准备顺序",
        "markdown": "1. 先准备凉菜并冷藏。\n2. 洗切西兰花，备好调料。\n3. 烹饪主菜，最后炒配菜。"
      },
      {
        "id": "note",
        "kind": "text",
        "markdown": "选择牛腩时，建议提前约两小时开始准备。复制清单会使用当前人数和主菜。"
      },
      {
        "id": "followup",
        "kind": "actions",
        "items": [
          {
            "id": "vegetarian",
            "kind": "model",
            "label": "改成全素菜单",
            "prompt": "根据这份计划和我的当前选择，重新设计全素菜单。"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "media": {
    "version": 1,
    "id": "images",
    "title": "把图片放进回答里",
    "inputs": [
      {
        "id": "cover",
        "kind": "choice",
        "label": "选择封面方向",
        "initial": "jetty",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "jetty",
            "label": "中心构图"
          },
          {
            "id": "diagonal",
            "label": "斜线构图"
          },
          {
            "id": "shore",
            "label": "岸边留白"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "resources": [
      {
        "id": "origin",
        "kind": "source",
        "url": "https://github.com/sachinchoolur/lightGallery",
        "title": "lightGallery 示例图库",
        "description": "演示图片的来源。此处只比较构图，不对拍摄地点作判断。"
      },
      {
        "id": "jetty",
        "kind": "image",
        "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sachinchoolur/lightGallery@9813e97837fddca82e4734bcbf4b77b0cd227772/site/static/images/demo/1-480.jpg",
        "alt": "湖面与栈桥，中心引导线",
        "sourceId": "origin"
      },
      {
        "id": "diagonal",
        "kind": "image",
        "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sachinchoolur/lightGallery@9813e97837fddca82e4734bcbf4b77b0cd227772/site/static/images/demo/4-480.jpg",
        "alt": "斜向延伸的栈桥",
        "sourceId": "origin"
      },
      {
        "id": "shore",
        "kind": "image",
        "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sachinchoolur/lightGallery@9813e97837fddca82e4734bcbf4b77b0cd227772/site/static/images/demo/13-480.jpg",
        "alt": "安静的岸边与留白",
        "sourceId": "origin"
      }
    ],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "intro",
        "kind": "text",
        "markdown": "图片、说明与来源留在同一条回答里。点击图片可按原始比例展开。"
      },
      {
        "id": "pictures",
        "kind": "gallery",
        "resourceIds": [
          "jetty",
          "diagonal",
          "shore"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "choose",
        "kind": "controls",
        "inputIds": [
          "cover"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "comparison",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "不同画面的用途",
        "items": [
          {
            "id": "a",
            "title": "中心构图",
            "description": "视线集中",
            "facts": [
              "适合标题居中",
              "纵深感较强"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "b",
            "title": "斜线构图",
            "description": "视线流动",
            "facts": [
              "适合内容导读",
              "保留图像边缘"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "c",
            "title": "岸边留白",
            "description": "气氛平静",
            "facts": [
              "适合短文封面",
              "注意文字对比度"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "sources",
        "kind": "sources",
        "title": "图片来源",
        "resourceIds": [
          "origin"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "research": {
    "version": 1,
    "id": "research",
    "title": "网页信息，变成可读的答案",
    "inputs": [],
    "resources": [
      {
        "id": "react",
        "kind": "source",
        "url": "https://react.dev/learn/preserving-and-resetting-state",
        "title": "React：保留与重置状态",
        "description": "组件类型、位置与 key 影响状态是否保留。长久的用户选择需要独立存储。"
      },
      {
        "id": "streams",
        "kind": "source",
        "url": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/streaming-responses",
        "title": "OpenAI：流式响应",
        "description": "传输层逐步接收事件。界面应以已经验证的完整内容单元提交。"
      }
    ],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "summary",
        "kind": "text",
        "markdown": "两条工程原则：**用户状态独立保存**；**完整区块验证后显示**。下面的来源可以展开摘要，也可打开原文。"
      },
      {
        "id": "sources",
        "kind": "sources",
        "resourceIds": [
          "react",
          "streams"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "more",
        "kind": "disclosure",
        "title": "如何用在 Forsion",
        "markdown": "人数与选项在本地更新。模型内容更新时保留用户已操作的值，历史记录继续使用原有工具事件恢复。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "pick": {
    "version": 1,
    "id": "cover-pick",
    "title": "选一张做封面",
    "inputs": [
      {
        "id": "cover",
        "kind": "choice",
        "label": "封面图",
        "initial": "jetty",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "jetty",
            "label": "中心构图",
            "description": "视线集中，适合标题居中",
            "imageId": "jetty"
          },
          {
            "id": "diagonal",
            "label": "斜线构图",
            "description": "视线流动，适合内容导读",
            "imageId": "diagonal"
          },
          {
            "id": "shore",
            "label": "岸边留白",
            "description": "气氛平静，适合短文封面",
            "imageId": "shore"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "resources": [
      {
        "id": "origin",
        "kind": "source",
        "url": "https://github.com/sachinchoolur/lightGallery",
        "title": "lightGallery 示例图库",
        "description": "演示图片的来源。此处只比较构图，不对拍摄地点作判断。"
      },
      {
        "id": "jetty",
        "kind": "image",
        "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sachinchoolur/lightGallery@9813e97837fddca82e4734bcbf4b77b0cd227772/site/static/images/demo/1-480.jpg",
        "alt": "湖面与栈桥，中心引导线",
        "sourceId": "origin"
      },
      {
        "id": "diagonal",
        "kind": "image",
        "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sachinchoolur/lightGallery@9813e97837fddca82e4734bcbf4b77b0cd227772/site/static/images/demo/4-480.jpg",
        "alt": "斜向延伸的栈桥",
        "sourceId": "origin"
      },
      {
        "id": "shore",
        "kind": "image",
        "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sachinchoolur/lightGallery@9813e97837fddca82e4734bcbf4b77b0cd227772/site/static/images/demo/13-480.jpg",
        "alt": "安静的岸边与留白",
        "sourceId": "origin"
      }
    ],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "intro",
        "kind": "text",
        "markdown": "三张候选图各有用途。点卡片就是选它；左上角的按钮只用来放大看。"
      },
      {
        "id": "choose",
        "kind": "controls",
        "inputIds": [
          "cover"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "shore-note",
        "kind": "text",
        "title": "用这张时注意",
        "markdown": "画面上半部分很亮，标题用深色字，别压在水面反光上。",
        "when": {
          "input": "cover",
          "equals": "shore"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
